  m_Text: "1. SUT UP & ENVIRONMENT:\n   \u2022 Sit facing the 3D interviewer across the executive desk.\n   \u2022 Hold right mouse button to look around your surroundings.\n\n2. ANSWERING QUESTIONS:\n   \u2022 Typed answers: Type directly into the response box.\n   \u2022 Voice answers: Click 'Record Voice Answer', speak into your microphone, then click 'Stop Recording' to transcribe.\n\n3. AI EVALUATION:\n   \u2022 Answers are evaluated for Relevance (40%), Clarity (30%), and Completeness (30%).\n   \u2022 Structured strengths and improvement recommendations are provided upon session completion."
